{
 "_provenance": "A rarity tier with no unit list draws every base unit of its rarity (player_state.expand_pool), which also\nhanded out Global's story cast (Rain, Lasswell, Fina, Nichol, Lid, Sakura, Jake), story NPCs and reward\nunits. The units Global's unit table marks `Fzmtn2Q5 = 0` (below 7 stars, with an English name) are checked\nagainst the FFBE wiki's Unit Infobox `acquisition` (research/wiki/units/):\n  * \"Story Units\", \"Reward Units\", \"Star Quartz Units\" or \"Raid Summon\" only: left out of those tiers (a\n    banner that features one still has it, and a Raid Summon's own list is untouched);\n  * \"Rare Summon\" or \"Standard Summon\": stay;\n  * anything else: stays, listed for the operator.\nThe story units' copies a player already owns stay; every rarity row of their families whose sell price\n(`u18nfD7p`, the client's UnitMst amountSell; GameUtils::canSellUnit needs it above 0) is 0 gets the usual\nprice for its rarity, served in the client's unit table (ios_tables.py), so extra copies can be sold.\nWrites source/server/content/summon_exclusions.json and ios-server/research/SUMMON_EXCLUSIONS.md.",
